id: magical-enhancement
name: Magical Enhancement
uaType: magical
prerequisite: Magic Score of 6+, 2+ Skill Ranks in Use Magic
tpCost: 10
type: standard
actionCost: 1
kiCostPerBaseTier: 2
# "Target an Ally within 8 Squares of you. That Character becomes Magically Enhanced until the end of their turn" - the
# Magically Enhanced mark on them, clocked to the end of their turn; Deeper Enhancement's and Unleash Dormant Power's
# extras asked with it (use-maneuver.mjs askEnhance, chat.mjs postEnhance).
enhances: true
source: Core Rule
description: >
  An Ally within 8 Squares is Magically Enhanced until the end of their turn: Combat Rolls and Soak Value 1(T) higher.
text: >
  Magical Enhancement: You are able to share your power with others, increasing their strength in place of your own.
  –Ability Type: Magical
  –Prerequisites: Magic Score of 6+, 2+ Skill Ranks in Use Magic
  –TP Cost: 10
  –KP Cost: 2(bT)
  –Maneuver Type: Standard
  –Action Cost: 1 Action
  –Minions: Non-Minion
  –Passive Bonus: N/A
  –Effect: Target an Ally within 8 Squares of you. That Character becomes Magically Enhanced until the end of their
  turn. A Magically Enhanced Character increases their Combat Rolls and Soak Value by 1(T).
